§ `Chapter II, Section 1 — Articles 5 to 7`

-- src:175 | Chương II
-- src:176 | QUY ĐỊNH VỀ BẢO HIỂM BẮT BUỘC TRÁCH NHIỆM DÂN SỰ
-- src:177 | CỦA CHỦ XE CƠ GIỚI
-- src:179 | Mục 1
-- src:180 | ĐIỀU KIỆN BẢO HIỂM, MỨC PHÍ BẢO HIỂM,
-- src:181 | GIỚI HẠN TRÁCH NHIỆM BẢO HIỂM

§§ `Article 5 — the object of the insurance`

-- The owner's civil liability to third parties and to passengers, "theo quy định của pháp luật":
-- the liability itself is fixed by civil law (the Civil Code), which is not in the sources. This
-- encoding takes the insured events of Article 7(1) as the measure of that liability.
-- src:183 | Điều 5. Đối tượng bảo hiểm
-- src:184 | Đối tượng bảo hiểm bắt buộc trách nhiệm dân sự của chủ xe cơ giới là trách
-- src:185 | nhiệm dân sự của chủ xe cơ giới đối với người thứ ba, hành khách theo quy định
-- src:186 | của pháp luật.
@ref Decree 67/2023 Article 5; Decree 220/2026 Article 9(1)
GIVEN v IS A `A vintage of Decree 67/2023`
      p IS A `A person harmed in the accident`
      a IS AN `An accident`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Article 5 — the owner's insured liability is owed to` v p a MEANS
        `Article 3(5)(a) — a third party` v p a
    OR  p's `a passenger on the vehicle`

§§ `Article 6 — the limits of liability`

-- (1) Health and life: 150 million đồng for one person in one accident. There is no
-- per-accident total for health and life.
-- src:187 | Điều 6. Giới hạn trách nhiệm bảo hiểm
-- src:188 | 1. Giới hạn trách nhiệm bảo hiểm đối với thiệt hại về sức khỏe, tính mạng do
-- src:189 | xe cơ giới gây ra là 150 triệu đồng cho một người trong một vụ tai nạn.
@ref Decree 67/2023 Article 6(1)
GIVETH A NUMBER
`Article 6(1) — the limit for health and life, per person per accident` MEANS 150000000

-- (2) Property, per accident: 50 million đồng for two- and three-wheeled motorcycles and mopeds
-- (electric ones included) and vehicles of similar structure; 100 million đồng for cars,
-- tractors, and trailers and semi-trailers towed by a car or tractor. Both lists are "theo quy
-- định của Luật Giao thông đường bộ": the Road Traffic Law defines the kinds (fork F3).
-- src:190 | 2. Giới hạn trách nhiệm bảo hiểm đối với thiệt hại về tài sản:
-- src:191 | a) Do xe mô tô hai bánh; xe mô tô ba bánh; xe gắn máy (kể cả xe máy điện) và
-- src:192 | các loại xe có kết cấu tương tự theo quy định của Luật Giao thông đường bộ gây ra
-- src:193 | là 50 triệu đồng trong một vụ tai nạn.
-- src:194 | b) Do xe ô tô; máy kéo; rơ moóc hoặc sơ mi rơ moóc được kéo bởi xe ô tô,
-- src:195 | máy kéo theo quy định của Luật Giao thông đường bộ gây ra là 100 triệu đồng
-- src:196 | trong một vụ tai nạn.
@ref Decree 67/2023 Article 6(2)(a)
GIVETH A NUMBER
`Article 6(2)(a) — the limit for property, per accident, for a motorcycle or moped` MEANS 50000000

@ref Decree 67/2023 Article 6(2)(b)
GIVETH A NUMBER
`Article 6(2)(b) — the limit for property, per accident, for a car, tractor or towed trailer` MEANS 100000000

-- Which point of Article 6(2) a class of Annex I falls under. Annex I and Article 6(2) name
-- their vehicles differently; this mapping is the encoder's (fork F3): sections I to III of
-- Annex I are point (a); sections IV to VII are cars, goods vehicles, tractors and tractor
-- units, point (b). A driving-school vehicle follows the vehicle of the same type.
GIVEN class IS A `A vehicle class in Annex I`
GIVETH A NUMBER
`Article 6(2) — the limit for property, per accident, for a vehicle of class` class MEANS
    CONSIDER class
    WHEN `a two-wheeled motorcycle` cc                  THEN `Article 6(2)(a) — the limit for property, per accident, for a motorcycle or moped`
    WHEN `a three-wheeled motorcycle`                   THEN `Article 6(2)(a) — the limit for property, per accident, for a motorcycle or moped`
    WHEN `an electric moped`                            THEN `Article 6(2)(a) — the limit for property, per accident, for a motorcycle or moped`
    WHEN `another moped or similar motor vehicle`       THEN `Article 6(2)(a) — the limit for property, per accident, for a motorcycle or moped`
    WHEN `a driving-school vehicle` same                THEN `Article 6(2) — the limit for property, per accident, for a vehicle of class` same
    OTHERWISE                                                `Article 6(2)(b) — the limit for property, per accident, for a car, tractor or towed trailer`

§§ `Article 7(1) — the scope of the insurance`

-- The insurer compensates: (a) non-contractual damage to the health, life and property of a
-- third party, and (b) damage to the health and life of the passengers on that vehicle; in
-- both, caused by the vehicle while in traffic or operating. A passenger's PROPERTY is in
-- neither point.
-- src:197 | Điều 7. Phạm vi bảo hiểm và loại trừ trách nhiệm bảo hiểm
-- src:198 | 1. Phạm vi bảo hiểm
-- src:199 | Doanh nghiệp bảo hiểm có trách nhiệm bồi thường cho những thiệt hại sau:
-- src:200 | a) Thiệt hại ngoài hợp đồng về sức khỏe, tính mạng và tài sản đối với người
-- src:201 | thứ ba do xe cơ giới tham gia giao thông, hoạt động gây ra.
-- src:202 | b) Thiệt hại về sức khỏe, tính mạng của hành khách trên chiếc xe đó do xe cơ
-- src:203 | giới tham gia giao thông, hoạt động gây ra.
@ref Decree 67/2023 Article 7(1), with Article 3(2)-(3)
GIVEN a IS AN `An accident`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`the vehicle was in traffic or operating` a MEANS
        `Article 3(3) — the vehicle was participating in traffic` a
    OR  `Article 3(2) — the vehicle was operating` a

@ref Decree 67/2023 Article 7(1)(a)-(b); Decree 220/2026 Article 9(1)
GIVEN v IS A `A vintage of Decree 67/2023`
      p IS A `A person harmed in the accident`
      a IS AN `An accident`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Article 7(1) — the harm to the person's health and life is within the scope` v p a MEANS
        `the vehicle was in traffic or operating` a
    AND (    `Article 3(5)(a) — a third party` v p a
         OR  p's `a passenger on the vehicle`)

@ref Decree 67/2023 Article 7(1)(a); Decree 220/2026 Article 9(1)
GIVEN v IS A `A vintage of Decree 67/2023`
      p IS A `A person harmed in the accident`
      a IS AN `An accident`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Article 7(1) — the damage to the person's property is within the scope` v p a MEANS
        `the vehicle was in traffic or operating` a
    AND `Article 3(5)(a) — a third party` v p a

§§ `Article 7(2) — the exclusions`

-- src:204 | 2. Các trường hợp loại trừ trách nhiệm bảo hiểm
-- src:205 | Doanh nghiệp bảo hiểm không có trách nhiệm bồi thường bảo hiểm trong các
-- src:206 | trường hợp sau:

-- (a) An intentional act causing the damage, by the owner, the driver or the injured person.
-- Fork F6: the injured person's intent excludes that person's own damage; the owner's or the
-- driver's excludes the accident.
-- src:209 | a) Hành động cố ý gây thiệt hại của chủ xe cơ giới, người lái xe hoặc người bị
-- src:210 | thiệt hại.
@ref Decree 67/2023 Article 7(2)(a)
GIVEN a IS AN `An accident`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Article 7(2)(a) — the owner or the driver acted intentionally` a MEANS
    a's `the owner or the driver acted intentionally to cause the damage`

-- (b) The driver who caused the accident deliberately fled without performing the owner's civil
-- liability. One who fled but performed it is not excluded.
-- src:211 | b) Người lái xe gây tai nạn cố ý bỏ chạy không thực hiện trách nhiệm dân sự
-- src:212 | của chủ xe cơ giới. Trường hợp người lái xe gây tai nạn cố ý bỏ chạy nhưng đã
-- src:213 | thực hiện trách nhiệm dân sự của chủ xe cơ giới thì không thuộc trường hợp loại
-- src:214 | trừ trách nhiệm bảo hiểm.
@ref Decree 67/2023 Article 7(2)(b)
GIVEN a IS AN `An accident`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Article 7(2)(b) — the driver fled without performing the owner's civil liability` a MEANS
        a's `the driver who caused it deliberately fled`
    AND NOT a's `the driver who fled had performed the owner's civil liability`

-- (c) The driver's age or licence. A driver whose licence was suspended for a term or revoked
-- is deemed to have none.
-- src:215 | c) Người lái xe không đủ điều kiện về độ tuổi theo quy định của Luật Giao
-- src:216 | thông đường bộ; người lái xe không có Giấy phép lái xe hoặc sử dụng Giấy phép
-- src:217 | lái xe không hợp lệ theo quy định của pháp luật về đào tạo, sát hạch, cấp giấy phép
-- src:218 | lái xe cơ giới đường bộ, Giấy phép lái xe bị tẩy xóa hoặc sử dụng Giấy phép lái xe
-- src:219 | hết hạn sử dụng tại thời điểm xảy ra tai nạn hoặc sử dụng Giấy phép lái xe không
-- src:220 | phù hợp đối với xe cơ giới bắt buộc phải có Giấy phép lái xe. Trường hợp người
-- src:221 | lái xe bị tước quyền sử dụng Giấy phép lái xe có thời hạn hoặc bị thu hồi Giấy
-- src:222 | phép lái xe thì được coi là không có Giấy phép lái xe.
-- FORK F5. The last limb ends "đối với xe cơ giới bắt buộc phải có Giấy phép lái xe" (for a
-- vehicle that must have a licence). Read with the last limb only (the last-antecedent
-- reading), every unlicensed driver is excluded, including the rider of a vehicle for which the
-- law requires no licence at all. This encoding reads the qualifier as governing every licence
-- limb (reading (ii)), so the licence limbs bite only where a licence is required; the age limb
-- bites always. The literal reading is kept below, under its own name, for the findings.
@ref Decree 67/2023 Article 7(2)(c), reading (ii) of fork F5
GIVEN a       IS AN `An accident`
      vehicle IS A `A motor vehicle`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Article 7(2)(c) — the driver's age or licence excludes the cover` a vehicle MEANS
        a's `the driver did not meet the age condition of the Road Traffic Law`
    OR  (    vehicle's `a driving licence is required to drive it`
         AND `the driver had no valid, matching licence` a)
    WHERE
        `the driver had no valid, matching licence` x MEANS
                x's `the driver had no driving licence`
            OR  x's `the driver used an invalid driving licence`
            OR  x's `the driver's licence was erased or altered`
            OR  x's `the driver's licence had expired at the time of the accident`
            OR  x's `the driver used a licence not matching the vehicle`
            OR  x's `the driver's right to use the licence was suspended for a term, or the licence was revoked`

@ref Decree 67/2023 Article 7(2)(c), the last-antecedent reading of fork F5 (NOT the reading taken)
GIVEN a       IS AN `An accident`
      vehicle IS A `A motor vehicle`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Article 7(2)(c), on the last-antecedent reading — the driver's age or licence excludes the cover` a vehicle MEANS
        a's `the driver did not meet the age condition of the Road Traffic Law`
    OR  a's `the driver had no driving licence`
    OR  a's `the driver used an invalid driving licence`
    OR  a's `the driver's licence was erased or altered`
    OR  a's `the driver's licence had expired at the time of the accident`
    OR  (    vehicle's `a driving licence is required to drive it`
         AND a's `the driver used a licence not matching the vehicle`)
    OR  a's `the driver's right to use the licence was suspended for a term, or the licence was revoked`

-- (d) Indirect consequences: loss of commercial value, loss tied to the use and exploitation of
-- the damaged property.
-- src:223 | d) Thiệt hại gây ra hậu quả gián tiếp bao gồm: giảm giá trị thương mại, thiệt
-- src:224 | hại gắn liền với việc sử dụng và khai thác tài sản bị thiệt hại.
-- (đ) Damage to PROPERTY where the driver's blood or breath alcohol was above the normal level in
-- the Ministry of Health's guidance, or the driver had used drugs or banned stimulants. Fork F7:
-- the drug limb, after the semicolon, is read as part of the same property-only exclusion.
-- src:225 | đ) Thiệt hại đối với tài sản do lái xe điều khiển xe cơ giới mà trong máu hoặc
-- src:226 | hơi thở có nồng độ cồn vượt quá mức trị số bình thường theo hướng dẫn của Bộ Y tế;
-- src:227 | sử dụng ma túy và chất kích thích bị cấm theo quy định của pháp luật.
@ref Decree 67/2023 Article 7(2)(đ)
GIVEN a IS AN `An accident`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Article 7(2)(dd) — alcohol or drugs` a MEANS
        a's `the driver's blood or breath alcohol exceeded the normal level in the Ministry of Health guidance`
    OR  a's `the driver had used drugs or banned stimulants`

-- (e) Property stolen or robbed in the accident. (g) Special property: gold, silver, precious
-- stones, valuable papers such as money, antiques, rare paintings, a body or remains.
-- src:228 | e) Thiệt hại đối với tài sản bị mất cắp hoặc bị cướp trong tai nạn.
-- src:229 | g) Thiệt hại đối với tài sản đặc biệt bao gồm: vàng, bạc, đá quý, các loại giấy tờ
-- src:230 | có giá trị như tiền, đồ cổ, tranh ảnh quý hiếm, thi hài, hài cốt.
-- (h) War, terrorism, earthquake.
-- src:231 | h) Thiệt hại do chiến tranh, khủng bố, động đất.

§§ `The answer on cover`

-- Each answer names the first provision, in the source's own order, that decides it.
@ref Decree 67/2023 Article 7(1)-(2); Decree 220/2026 Article 9(1)
GIVEN v       IS A `A vintage of Decree 67/2023`
      p       IS A `A person harmed in the accident`
      a       IS AN `An accident`
      vehicle IS A `A motor vehicle`
GIVETH A `The answer on cover`
`Article 7 — the answer on cover for the health and life of` v p a vehicle MEANS
    BRANCH
        IF NOT `the vehicle was in traffic or operating` a
            THEN `outside the scope: the vehicle was neither in road traffic nor operating`
        IF NOT `Article 7(1) — the harm to the person's health and life is within the scope` v p a
            THEN `outside the scope: the person is neither a third party nor a passenger`
        IF `Article 7(2)(a) — the owner or the driver acted intentionally` a
            THEN `excluded: an intentional act of the owner or the driver`
        IF p's `acted intentionally to cause the damage`
            THEN `excluded: an intentional act of the injured person`
        IF `Article 7(2)(b) — the driver fled without performing the owner's civil liability` a
            THEN `excluded: the driver fled without performing the owner's civil liability`
        IF `Article 7(2)(c) — the driver's age or licence excludes the cover` a vehicle
            THEN `excluded: the driver's age or licence`
        IF a's `caused by war, terrorism or an earthquake`
            THEN `excluded: war, terrorism or an earthquake`
        OTHERWISE `covered`

@ref Decree 67/2023 Article 7(1)(a), 7(2); Decree 220/2026 Article 9(1)
GIVEN v       IS A `A vintage of Decree 67/2023`
      p       IS A `A person harmed in the accident`
      item    IS AN `An item of damaged property`
      a       IS AN `An accident`
      vehicle IS A `A motor vehicle`
GIVETH A `The answer on cover`
`Article 7 — the answer on cover for an item of property of` v p item a vehicle MEANS
    BRANCH
        IF NOT `the vehicle was in traffic or operating` a
            THEN `outside the scope: the vehicle was neither in road traffic nor operating`
        IF     p's `a passenger on the vehicle`
           AND NOT `Article 3(5)(a) — a third party` v p a
            THEN `outside the scope: a passenger's property is not covered`
        IF NOT `Article 7(1) — the damage to the person's property is within the scope` v p a
            THEN `outside the scope: the person is neither a third party nor a passenger`
        IF `Article 7(2)(a) — the owner or the driver acted intentionally` a
            THEN `excluded: an intentional act of the owner or the driver`
        IF p's `acted intentionally to cause the damage`
            THEN `excluded: an intentional act of the injured person`
        IF `Article 7(2)(b) — the driver fled without performing the owner's civil liability` a
            THEN `excluded: the driver fled without performing the owner's civil liability`
        IF `Article 7(2)(c) — the driver's age or licence excludes the cover` a vehicle
            THEN `excluded: the driver's age or licence`
        IF item's `an indirect consequence: loss of commercial value, or loss tied to the use and exploitation of the damaged property`
            THEN `excluded: an indirect consequence`
        IF `Article 7(2)(dd) — alcohol or drugs` a
            THEN `excluded: alcohol or drugs, for damage to property`
        IF item's `stolen or robbed in the accident`
            THEN `excluded: property stolen or robbed in the accident`
        IF item's `special property: gold, silver, precious stones, valuable papers such as money, antiques, rare paintings, a body or remains`
            THEN `excluded: special property`
        IF a's `caused by war, terrorism or an earthquake`
            THEN `excluded: war, terrorism or an earthquake`
        OTHERWISE `covered`

-- The same two answers for a contract: the vintage comes from the contract (nd67-ch1-general.l4),
-- and a contract left under the earlier rules is declined first, before any fact is read (a
-- refusal only refuses when something forces it, so it is in return position here).
@ref Decree 67/2023 Article 7; Article 76(1); Decree 220/2026 Article 10(2)
GIVEN c IS A `A contract of compulsory motor insurance`
      p IS A `A person harmed in the accident`
      a IS AN `An accident`
GIVETH A `The answer on cover`
`the answer on cover under the contract for the health and life of` c p a MEANS
    CONSIDER `the rules that govern` c
    WHEN `the rules Article 76(1) continues for a contract concluded before Decree 67/2023` THEN `a contract concluded before Decree 67/2023 is governed by earlier rules not encoded in this model`
    WHEN `Decree 67/2023, in the vintage` v THEN `Article 7 — the answer on cover for the health and life of` v p a (c's `the vehicle`)

@ref Decree 67/2023 Article 7; Article 76(1); Decree 220/2026 Article 10(2)
GIVEN c    IS A `A contract of compulsory motor insurance`
      p    IS A `A person harmed in the accident`
      item IS AN `An item of damaged property`
      a    IS AN `An accident`
GIVETH A `The answer on cover`
`the answer on cover under the contract for an item of property of` c p item a MEANS
    CONSIDER `the rules that govern` c
    WHEN `the rules Article 76(1) continues for a contract concluded before Decree 67/2023` THEN `a contract concluded before Decree 67/2023 is governed by earlier rules not encoded in this model`
    WHEN `Decree 67/2023, in the vintage` v THEN `Article 7 — the answer on cover for an item of property of` v p item a (c's `the vehicle`)
